How to make a new release:
==========================

Update the following files with the new release ID:

	Makefile.pkgsrc
        RELEASE_NOTES
	vers.c
        vrfy.1

Note:

	VERSION=$(make -V VERSION)

Tag the release:

	git tag -s -m "Implement -P port# to set an optional port number." v${VERSION}

    or in Magit:

	t -s r

Create the release as a "release" on Github:

        gh release create v${VERSION} -t "v${VERSION}" -n "Implement -P port# to set an optional port number."

    add a '-p' (and adjust tag name and title) to make it a pre-release

Push the distribution archive:

	make dist
	scp vrfy-${VERSION}.tar.gz central:/var/spool/ftp/pub/Planix/
        ssh central "ln -fs /var/spool/ftp/pub/Planix/vrfy-${VERSION}.tar.gz /var/spool/ftp/pub/Planix/vrfy.tar.gz"

Fix up the pkgsrc shar:

	cp Makefile.pkgsrc /usr/pkgsrc/mail/vrfy
	cd mail/vrfy
        make fetch
        make makesum
        shar DESCR Makefile PLIST distinfo patches/patch-Makefile > ~/tmp/vrfy-${VERSION}-pkgsrc.shar
	scp ~/tmp/vrfy-${VERSION}-pkgsrc.shar central:/var/spool/ftp/pub/Planix/
        ssh central 'ln -fs /var/spool/ftp/pub/Planix/vrfy-${VERSION}-pkgsrc.shar /var/spool/ftp/pub/Planix/vrfy-pkgsrc.shar'
